\subsubsection{Question-Type 2: Summary to Question}
\label{question}
This task entails generating a short-answer question from a summary and the name of the person in the summary. For example, given the following input:

\textit{'A young girl is walking home late one night and is attacked by a man on a street corner.'}

The system should generate a question starting with: \textit{'Who...?'} such as: \textit{'Who attacked the young girl?'} or \textit{'Who attacked the girl?'}

